  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East Micronesia Cable System - Pacific - Telecommunications</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The East Micronesia Cable (EMC) project will: (i) deliver a 2,070km trunk cable from Tarawa (Kiribati) to Pohnpei (FSM); and (ii) deliver spurs off the trunk to establish new connections in Nauru and Kosrae (FSM); to (iii) enhance internet accessibility by providing affordable, quality, secure and reliable connectivity to the three EMC countries.</narrative>
  </description>
